exports[`runs the economy swarm through the Loader and real tool registry without paid requests 1`] = `"[{"type":"text","text":"## Swarm — done\\n\\n**Request:** What is 2 + 2?\\n\\n1 of 1 unit(s) reported.\\n\\n### \`answer\` write answer\\n\\n_free-a · 0s_\\n\\n4\\n\\nPaid review: ACCEPT: yes\\nAnswer is 4.\\n\\n**Execution estimate** — 10 seat call(s) in 1 wave(s) of 1\\n\\n- Metered cost: **$0.0000**\\n- On a free seat (no cost, no quota): 6 seat call(s)\\n- Unpriced, so missing from the total: 4 seat call(s)\\n\\n> each seat call is assumed to produce ~6,000 output tokens with 4x that in input\\n> 4 seat call(s) run on a provider with no published price and are missing from the total\\n> 6 seat call(s) run on a free seat: no metered cost and no subscription quota, but a free tier is slower and fails more often\\n> a wide wave runs many workers at once: spend arrives faster than a sequential run, even though the total is the same\\n> Mode estimate includes candidate source reads, selection, paid reviews and the bounded fallback; wave sizes count work units. Unused calls are not spent."}]"`;
